WEBVTT

06b43b6dac9f-1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.587
Madeleine Albright was a recipient of the Presidential Medal of Freedom.

06b43b6dac9f-2
00:00:04.952 --> 00:00:17.583
On May 29, 2012, eleven years after her farewell remarks as Secretary of State, President Barack Obama presented it during a ceremony in the East Room of the White House.

